OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FMark Forrest introduces highlights
OL,12,     Ffrom the Proms including music by
OL,13,     FSibelius plus chamber performances
OL,14,     Ffrom this years Ryedale Festival
OL,15,     Fand Baroque music from Fribourg.
OL,16,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mozart
OL,17,     F1/1. Kate Molleson tells Mozart's
OL,18,     Fstory through five of the
OL,19,     Frelationships that shaped the
OL,20,     Fcomposer and his music - from his
OL,21,     Ffriends and family to a mentor and
OL,22,     Fa supposed rival.
